<title>ITALY: Prodi says 1988 budget will include welfare reform.</title>
<headline>Prodi says 1988 budget will include welfare reform.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Minister Romano Prodi said on Thursday that welfare reform would be included the 1998 Italian budget.</p>
<p>He made the announcement during a news conference after the cabinet meeting that approved Italy's 15.5 trillion cost-cutting mini-budget.</p>
<p>He said the government would begin talks with unions and business leaders on welfare reform.</p>
</text>
